1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,536
Hamburgers, egg pancakes, sizzling noodles

2
00:00:02,536 --> 00:00:05,806
Rice balls, toast, and savory soy milk

3
00:00:05,806 --> 00:00:08,742
There are so many delicious breakfasts
around the world

4
00:00:08,742 --> 00:00:12,279
I'm going to collect them all in my
breakfast truck

5
00:00:13,480 --> 00:00:14,214
And so,

6
00:00:14,214 --> 00:00:16,083
Beelu, who loves breakfast,

7
00:00:16,083 --> 00:00:18,819
set off on an adventure to collect

8
00:00:18,819 --> 00:00:20,420
all kinds of breakfast!

9
00:00:56,256 --> 00:00:58,325
That was fun!

10
00:01:00,127 --> 00:01:02,129
Let's find breakfast!

11
00:01:02,129 --> 00:01:04,665
Good morning, Beelu! Good morning, kids!

12
00:01:04,665 --> 00:01:07,868
Today's breakfast is milkfish soup

13
00:01:07,868 --> 00:01:09,736
In the adventure story coming up,

14
00:01:09,736 --> 00:01:12,339
there will be three milkfish soup stickers

15
00:01:12,339 --> 00:01:13,807
Help Beelu

16
00:01:13,807 --> 00:01:16,009
find where they are!

17
00:01:16,009 --> 00:01:18,478
Let's collect today's breakfast!

18
00:01:21,348 --> 00:01:24,284
Fresh farm-raised milkfish

19
00:01:24,284 --> 00:01:27,888
Simmered over high heat until rich and
tasty

20
00:01:27,888 --> 00:01:30,223
The best milkfish soup breakfast shop

21
00:01:30,223 --> 00:01:31,024
Here I come!

22
00:01:31,024 --> 00:01:31,892
Here I come!

23
00:01:35,896 --> 00:01:37,030
That's strange

24
00:01:37,030 --> 00:01:39,166
This place doesn't look anything like the
picture

25
00:01:41,568 --> 00:01:44,571
Maybe I should go

26
00:01:44,571 --> 00:01:45,639
Wait!

27
00:01:47,040 --> 00:01:47,774
This is it!

28
00:01:47,774 --> 00:01:50,911
This is definitely the milkfish soup
breakfast shop you're looking for

29
00:01:54,381 --> 00:01:55,048
But...

30
00:01:55,048 --> 00:01:57,050
This shop

31
00:01:57,050 --> 00:01:58,585
And you

32
00:01:58,585 --> 00:02:02,189
Look nothing like the photo

33
00:02:02,189 --> 00:02:03,056
Really?

34
00:02:03,924 --> 00:02:06,593
Everyone says I look better in person

35
00:02:10,197 --> 00:02:12,199
Have a seat

36
00:02:12,199 --> 00:02:15,669
My son will be back with the fish in a
moment

37
00:02:15,669 --> 00:02:16,937
Oh!

38
00:02:16,937 --> 00:02:18,338
Ah, sorry, sorry!

39
00:02:18,338 --> 00:02:21,942
I won't use double-sided tape to stick up
the sign again

40
00:02:23,010 --> 00:02:25,012
I think I'd better not eat here

41
00:02:25,879 --> 00:02:26,880
Please don't go!

42
00:02:26,880 --> 00:02:28,081
Please wait!

43
00:02:28,081 --> 00:02:30,217
Just give me a chance!

44
00:02:34,821 --> 00:02:37,157
That shop was so strange

45
00:02:38,492 --> 00:02:41,962
Where is a good milkfish soup breakfast
shop?

46
00:02:41,962 --> 00:02:43,230
Where is it, anyway?

47
00:02:46,233 --> 00:02:48,502
Can someone help me?

48
00:02:48,502 --> 00:02:50,704
My wallet fell into the river

49
00:02:53,173 --> 00:02:54,241
Don't cry

50
00:02:54,241 --> 00:02:57,444
I know your wallet fell into the river

51
00:02:57,444 --> 00:02:59,179
I'll help you look for it

52
00:03:03,050 --> 00:03:05,852
Huh? The water here is so shallow

53
00:03:05,852 --> 00:03:06,920
Little brother

54
00:03:06,920 --> 00:03:08,855
Do you want to come down and look with me?

55
00:03:11,258 --> 00:03:11,858
I...

56
00:03:15,996 --> 00:03:18,865
I'm afraid of water

57
00:03:18,865 --> 00:03:22,002
All right, all right. I'll look by myself

58
00:03:22,002 --> 00:03:23,470
Don't cry

59
00:03:25,138 --> 00:03:28,875
Wallet, wallet. Is this it?

60
00:03:30,343 --> 00:03:34,281
Wallet, wallet. Is this it?

61
00:03:35,949 --> 00:03:36,950
Is it this one?

62
00:03:37,284 --> 00:03:38,151
This one?

63
00:03:38,618 --> 00:03:39,352
Or this one?

64
00:03:39,352 --> 00:03:40,954
Was the wallet you dropped this gold one,

65
00:03:40,954 --> 00:03:42,556
or the silver one?

66
00:03:42,556 --> 00:03:43,824
Neither

67
00:03:43,824 --> 00:03:46,159
It was a blue coin purse

68
00:03:46,159 --> 00:03:46,960
You're very honest...

69
00:03:48,628 --> 00:03:49,896
That's strange

70
00:03:49,896 --> 00:03:52,833
Why is there so much trash in this river?

71
00:03:54,634 --> 00:03:55,902
What should I do?

72
00:03:55,902 --> 00:03:57,237
The money in the wallet

73
00:03:57,237 --> 00:03:59,573
was supposed to buy fish

74
00:03:59,573 --> 00:04:01,374
If we can't buy the fish,

75
00:04:01,374 --> 00:04:05,378
Dad's breakfast shop can't reopen

76
00:04:05,712 --> 00:04:07,380
Reopen?

77
00:04:07,848 --> 00:04:08,849
That's right

78
00:04:08,849 --> 00:04:13,053
Our family used to run a famous breakfast
shop here

79
00:04:13,053 --> 00:04:15,122
Isn't this the place I've been looking
for?

80
00:04:15,122 --> 00:04:17,124
The milkfish soup breakfast shop?

81
00:04:17,858 --> 00:04:19,259
But our shop

82
00:04:19,259 --> 00:04:22,395
no longer looks like the photo

83
00:04:25,532 --> 00:04:28,735
A huge typhoon hit this year

84
00:04:28,735 --> 00:04:32,672
Our whole town was flooded

85
00:04:41,014 --> 00:04:45,152
Help! Help!

86
00:05:02,235 --> 00:05:04,437
After that typhoon,

87
00:05:04,437 --> 00:05:06,706
our breakfast shop was destroyed

88
00:05:06,706 --> 00:05:09,376
Dad got sick

89
00:05:09,376 --> 00:05:11,845
Our family ran out of money

90
00:05:14,581 --> 00:05:16,650
Dad looked everywhere for work

91
00:05:16,650 --> 00:05:19,119
But when people saw how sick he was,

92
00:05:19,119 --> 00:05:21,054
they all kept their distance

93
00:05:25,926 --> 00:05:30,530
It took our family a long time to get back
on our feet

94
00:05:30,530 --> 00:05:33,333
Dad, I drew this sign for you

95
00:05:33,333 --> 00:05:35,402
Oh, that's great

96
00:05:39,206 --> 00:05:42,676
Today is the reopening day

97
00:05:42,676 --> 00:05:45,946
So I have to finish Dad's task

98
00:05:45,946 --> 00:05:49,216
Find the wallet and buy the fish

99
00:06:10,904 --> 00:06:15,442
Where is it? Where's the wallet?

100
00:06:15,442 --> 00:06:19,980
This money is for the reopening

101
00:06:21,848 --> 00:06:24,851
Little brother, let me help you

102
00:06:24,851 --> 00:06:29,122
Sorry, I'm still really afraid of water

103
00:06:29,122 --> 00:06:31,258
You've already done great

104
00:06:31,258 --> 00:06:34,861
But if we can't find the wallet,

105
00:06:34,861 --> 00:06:38,331
Don't worry. Let's think of a way together

106
00:06:56,883 --> 00:06:58,752
It's Brain Workout Time!

107
00:06:58,752 --> 00:07:02,422
Circle your left hand, circle your right hand

108
00:07:02,422 --> 00:07:04,357
Clap! Clap!

109
00:07:04,357 --> 00:07:05,425
Jump up!

110
00:07:05,425 --> 00:07:05,759
Jump up!

111
00:07:05,759 --> 00:07:06,092
Jump up!

112
00:07:06,226 --> 00:07:09,963
Move your left brain, move your right
brain

113
00:07:09,963 --> 00:07:11,698
Clap! Clap!

114
00:07:11,698 --> 00:07:11,965
Jump up!

115
00:07:12,098 --> 00:07:12,632
Jump up!

116
00:07:12,632 --> 00:07:13,500
Jump up!

117
00:07:13,500 --> 00:07:17,237
Make a sun with your hands and say good
morning

118
00:07:17,237 --> 00:07:19,506
Clap! Clap!

119
00:07:19,506 --> 00:07:21,975
Bi Ru Akokay

120
00:07:25,779 --> 00:07:26,913
Oh!

121
00:07:26,913 --> 00:07:28,782
I've got a good idea

122
00:07:35,789 --> 00:07:37,257
Mm-hmm!

123
00:07:37,257 --> 00:07:40,860
Bring over the trash we just fished out

124
00:07:40,860 --> 00:07:43,997
We'll take it apart and rebuild it

125
00:07:45,799 --> 00:07:47,534
There!

126
00:07:47,534 --> 00:07:49,069
If we don't have money to buy fish,

127
00:07:49,069 --> 00:07:51,004
we'll catch them instead!

128
00:08:05,819 --> 00:08:10,557
Strange. Why is it taking Little Brother
so long to buy fish?

129
00:08:10,557 --> 00:08:12,692
Did something happen to him on the way?

130
00:08:12,692 --> 00:08:14,027
Dad!

131
00:08:14,027 --> 00:08:16,363
I brought the fish back!

132
00:08:18,365 --> 00:08:21,368
Wow, that's a lot of fish!

133
00:08:21,368 --> 00:08:25,372
Beelu helped me catch these fish

134
00:08:25,372 --> 00:08:26,706
You are...

135
00:08:26,706 --> 00:08:28,708
I'm really sorry about earlier

136
00:08:28,708 --> 00:08:31,845
Could I have a bowl of your milkfish soup?

137
00:08:32,579 --> 00:08:34,447
Of course. Welcome!

138
00:08:37,317 --> 00:08:39,586
Could I have a bowl too?

139
00:08:39,586 --> 00:08:41,721
Oh, you're...

140
00:08:42,589 --> 00:08:45,325
You're the reporter who took our picture
last time

141
00:08:46,593 --> 00:08:49,329
I've been worried about you since the
typhoon

142
00:08:49,329 --> 00:08:51,865
I'm so glad you're all safe

143
00:08:53,733 --> 00:08:56,803
Today is the reopening day of our shop

144
00:08:56,803 --> 00:08:58,405
Come and eat with us!

145
00:08:58,405 --> 00:08:59,672
Sure!

146
00:08:59,672 --> 00:09:03,209
After you eat, please let me write another
story about you

147
00:09:03,209 --> 00:09:05,545
Really? That's wonderful!

148
00:09:08,281 --> 00:09:10,483
That was fun!

149
00:09:24,230 --> 00:09:26,099
Let's find breakfast!

150
00:09:26,099 --> 00:09:28,034
Here are the answers!

151
00:09:28,034 --> 00:09:30,503
Today's breakfast stickers are in these
places

152
00:09:34,374 --> 00:09:35,975
Did you find them?

153
00:09:38,912 --> 00:09:41,314
Yeah, I knew it!

154
00:09:43,049 --> 00:09:46,052
How do you make delicious milkfish soup?

155
00:09:46,052 --> 00:09:46,719
First,

156
00:09:46,719 --> 00:09:48,655
wash the milkfish

157
00:09:50,390 --> 00:09:52,325
Cut the fish into pieces

158
00:09:53,793 --> 00:09:55,595
Add salt and rice wine

159
00:09:55,595 --> 00:09:56,863
Mix well and marinate

160
00:09:57,931 --> 00:10:00,467
Next, shred some ginger and slice some
scallions

161
00:10:00,467 --> 00:10:01,601
Boil a pot of water

162
00:10:02,469 --> 00:10:05,004
Add the fish head and tail and simmer

163
00:10:05,004 --> 00:10:07,140
Wait a little while

164
00:10:07,140 --> 00:10:08,608
Skim off the impurities

165
00:10:09,676 --> 00:10:11,744
Finally, add the shredded ginger

166
00:10:11,744 --> 00:10:13,012
The fish

167
00:10:13,012 --> 00:10:14,347
And the chopped scallions

168
00:10:14,347 --> 00:10:16,216
Cook a little longer

169
00:10:16,216 --> 00:10:19,219
And a pot of delicious milkfish soup is
ready!

170
00:10:19,219 --> 00:10:22,489
Wow, it looks delicious!

171
00:10:25,291 --> 00:10:29,896
Hmm, are there lots of bones in milkfish
soup?

172
00:10:30,230 --> 00:10:31,097
Huh?

173
00:10:33,967 --> 00:10:35,435
Shoo! Shoo!

174
00:10:35,435 --> 00:10:38,037
Don't steal our fish!

175
00:10:38,972 --> 00:10:40,039
Excuse me,

176
00:10:40,039 --> 00:10:43,710
why don't birds need to pick out bones
when they eat fish?

177
00:10:43,710 --> 00:10:46,913
Aren't they afraid fish bones might get
stuck in their throats?

178
00:10:46,913 --> 00:10:48,181
That's because...

179
00:10:48,181 --> 00:10:51,584
Most birds don't have teeth

180
00:10:51,584 --> 00:10:53,119
so when they eat fish,

181
00:10:53,119 --> 00:10:54,521
they swallow it whole

182
00:10:54,521 --> 00:10:57,524
When the fish bones are wrapped in the
flesh

183
00:10:57,524 --> 00:10:59,526
and swallowed straight into the stomach,

184
00:10:59,526 --> 00:11:02,862
the bones won't prick their throats

185
00:11:02,862 --> 00:11:05,732
Some birds, when eating fish,

186
00:11:05,732 --> 00:11:08,001
turn the fish's head toward their mouths

187
00:11:08,001 --> 00:11:11,538
and swallow in the direction the scales
and fins grow

188
00:11:11,538 --> 00:11:15,341
This also keeps the scales and fins from
scratching their throats

189
00:11:16,543 --> 00:11:20,146
Penguins have backward-pointing barbs
inside their mouths and on their tongues

190
00:11:20,146 --> 00:11:22,749
Once a live, wriggling fish enters their
mouths,

191
00:11:22,749 --> 00:11:25,818
the barbs grip it tightly

192
00:11:25,818 --> 00:11:28,021
so it can only move down into the stomach

193
00:11:28,021 --> 00:11:31,224
Oh, I see!

194
00:11:31,224 --> 00:11:32,358
Besides birds,

195
00:11:32,358 --> 00:11:35,495
people in Taiwan are experts at eating
fish too

196
00:11:35,495 --> 00:11:36,429
In Taiwan,

197
00:11:36,429 --> 00:11:39,165
people have been eating milkfish for over
300 years

198
00:11:39,165 --> 00:11:43,102
Fish cooks have mastered the skill over
many years

199
00:11:43,102 --> 00:11:45,104
They can remove every single bone

200
00:11:45,104 --> 00:11:47,774
Like this bowl of milkfish soup in front
of you,

201
00:11:47,774 --> 00:11:50,243
it doesn't have a single bone in it

202
00:11:50,243 --> 00:11:53,112
Oh, then I can eat without worrying!
